      "intent": "Protect the fleet and beaches, deliver airborne troops and restrict German reinforcement while the seaborne armies established a lodgement.",
      "air": "Airborne transport, protective patrols, beach bombardment and inland attacks performed different jobs. At Omaha, the survival of defences showed that the size of the air effort did not guarantee destruction of a particular strongpoint.",
